<title>UK: Greycoat says examining Moorfield proposal.</title>
<headline>Greycoat says examining Moorfield proposal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property group Greycoat said it is examining a merger proposal from its smaller rival Moorfield Estates and is seeking more information from the company.</p>
<p>&quot;A list of some 30 questions has already been submitted to Moorfield's advisers seeking clarification of the material presented,&quot; said Greycoat in a statement.</p>
</text>
